.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> </span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Deals <span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\">Weapon Damage</span>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</li></ul></li>\n<li>Deal half damage to creatures directly behind your initial target</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Woyy\" title=\"Woyy\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Woyy.png/25px-Portrait_Woyy.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Woyy.png/38px-Portrait_Woyy.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Woyy.png/50px-Portrait_Woyy.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Woyy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Woyy.png/25px-Portrait_Woyy.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Portrait_Woyy.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Woyy\" title=\"Woyy\">Woyy</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Facemaker%27s_Boutique\" title=\"Facemaker's Boutique\">Facemaker's Boutique</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-164&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-45</span></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>It appears only one of these arrows can be obtained during any given playthrough.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715053420\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.054 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1751/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25593/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5784/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1049182/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   45.428      1 Template:Misc_item_page\n100.00%   45.428      1 -total\n 49.39%   22.435      8 Template:Icon_text\n 42.78%   19.433     18 Template:Trim\n 21.09%    9.581      2 Template:Uid\n 13.93%    6.326      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.07%    5.483      2 Template:Template_style\n 11.52%    5.235      2 Template:Icon_link\n 10.04%    4.559      8 Template:Ifempty\n  9.97%    4.528      1 Template:PageSeo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:19739-0!canon